<section class="nb-policy nb-policy--terms">
  <div class="nb-policy__hero">
    <span class="nb-policy__hero-badge">LEGAL</span>
    <h1 class="nb-policy__hero-title">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="nb-policy__hero-sub">The terms that govern your use of our website and purchases.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="nb-policy__wrap">
    <div class="nb-policy__intro">
      Welcome to NexaBrand USA™. By accessing or using our website and placing an order, you agree to be bound by the following Terms of Service. Please read them carefully before using our site.
    </div>

    <div class="nb-policy__card">
      <h2 class="nb-policy__section-title">
        <span class="nb-policy__icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg>
        </span>
        1. Acceptance of Terms
      </h2>
      <p class="nb-policy__body">By accessing this website and/or purchasing from us, you confirm that you are at least 18 years of age (or accessing the site under the supervision of a parent or guardian) and that you accept these Terms of Service in full. If you do not agree, please do not use our website.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="nb-policy__card">
      <h2 class="nb-policy__section-title">
        <span class="nb-policy__icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21v-1a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h4a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v1"/></svg>
        </span>
        2. Use of Our Website
      </h2>
      <p class="nb-policy__body">You agree to use our website only for lawful purposes. You may not use the site in any way that breaches applicable laws or regulations, infringes the rights of others, or interferes with the operation, security, or availability of the website.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="nb-policy__card">
      <h2 class="nb-policy__section-title">
        <span class="nb-policy__icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.59 13.41 13.42 20.6a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0L2 12V2h10l8.59 8.59a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.82z"/><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="1.2" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
        </span>
        3. Products &amp; Pricing
      </h2>
      <p class="nb-policy__body">We make every effort to display our products and prices accurately. However, we reserve the right to correct any errors, modify prices, and update product information at any time without prior notice. All prices are listed in U.S. dollars (USD) and exclude applicable taxes unless stated otherwise.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="nb-policy__card">
      <h2 class="nb-policy__section-title">
        <span class="nb-policy__icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M2 10h20"/></svg>
        </span>
        4. Orders &amp; Payment
      </h2>
      <p class="nb-policy__body">All orders are subject to acceptance and product availability. We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order at our discretion, including in cases of suspected fraud or pricing errors. Payment must be received in full before an order is processed and shipped.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="nb-policy__card">
      <h2 class="nb-policy__section-title">
        <span class="nb-policy__icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4M21 9V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4M3 15v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4"/></svg>
        </span>
        5. Shipping, Returns &amp; Refunds
      </h2>
      <p class="nb-policy__body">Order fulfillment, delivery timelines, returns, and refunds are governed by our <a href="/pages/shipping" class="nb-policy__email">Shipping Policy</a> and <a href="/pages/returns" class="nb-policy__email">Return &amp; Refund Policy</a>, which form part of these Terms of Service.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="nb-policy__card">
      <h2 class="nb-policy__section-title">
        <span class="nb-policy__icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 8 8 10 4.5-2 8-5 8-10V6l-8-4z"/></svg>
        </span>
        6. Intellectual Property
      </h2>
      <p class="nb-policy__body">All content on this website — including logos, text, images, graphics, product names, and branding — is the property of NexaBrand USA™ and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or use any content without our prior written permission.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="nb-policy__card">
      <h2 class="nb-policy__section-title">
        <span class="nb-policy__icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M4.93 4.93l14.14 14.14"/></svg>
        </span>
        7. Prohibited Activities
      </h2>
      <div class="nb-policy__chips">
        <span class="nb-policy__chip">Fraudulent or unauthorized transactions</span>
        <span class="nb-policy__chip">Reselling without authorization</span>
        <span class="nb-policy__chip">Copying or scraping site content</span>
        <span class="nb-policy__chip">Disrupting site security or operation</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="nb-policy__card">
      <h2 class="nb-policy__section-title">
        <span class="nb-policy__icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><path d="M12 9v4"/><circle cx="12" cy="17" r="0.6" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
        </span>
        8. Limitation of Liability
      </h2>
      <p class="nb-policy__body">Our products and website are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. To the fullest extent permitted by law, NexaBrand USA™ shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of our website or products. Our skincare products are cosmetic and are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="nb-policy__card">
      <h2 class="nb-policy__section-title">
        <span class="nb-policy__icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h12"/></svg>
        </span>
        9. Governing Law
      </h2>
      <p class="nb-policy__body">These Terms of Service are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Missouri and the United States, without regard to conflict-of-law principles. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts located in Missouri, USA.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="nb-policy__card">
      <h2 class="nb-policy__section-title">
        <span class="nb-policy__icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg>
        </span>
        10. Changes to These Terms
      </h2>
      <p class="nb-policy__body">We may update or revise these Terms of Service at any time. Changes take effect as soon as they are posted on this page. Your continued use of our website after any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="nb-policy__help">
      <div class="nb-policy__help-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9.5 9.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 4.5 1.5c-1 .8-2 1-2 2.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="17" r="0.6" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="nb-policy__help-title">Questions about these terms?</div>
        <div class="nb-policy__help-sub">Email us at <a href="mailto:support@nexabrandusa.com" class="nb-policy__email">support@nexabrandusa.com</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  .nb-policy {
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F0F9FB 0%, #FBF8F2 60%, #FFFFFF 100%);
    color: #1F2A2E;
    padding-bottom: 90px;
  }
  .nb-policy__hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0E2F36 0%, #1A3A42 50%, #2F8FA3 100%);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 90px 24px 90px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .nb-policy__hero::before, .nb-policy__hero::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(70px);
    opacity: 0.4;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .nb-policy__hero::before { width: 320px; height: 320px; top: -100px; left: -60px; background: #4AACBF; }
  .nb-policy__hero::after { width: 280px; height: 280px; bottom: -100px; right: -50px; background: #8DD3E3; }
  .nb-policy__hero > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .nb-policy__hero-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    color: #B9E8F5;
    padding: 7px 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(185,232,245,0.4);
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .nb-policy__hero-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 52px);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .nb-policy__hero-sub {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .nb-policy__wrap {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: -40px auto 0;
    padding: 0 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .nb-policy__intro {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 26px 30px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(74,172,191,0.18);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(26,58,66,0.06);
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #4B5A60;
    line-height: 1.75;
    border-left: 3px solid #4AACBF;
  }
  .nb-policy__card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 28px 30px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(74,172,191,0.18);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(26,58,66,0.06);
    transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .nb-policy__card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 28px; bottom: 28px;
    width: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #4AACBF, #8DD3E3);
    border-radius: 0 3px 3px 0;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s;
  }
  .nb-policy__card:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
    border-color: rgba(74,172,191,0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(26,58,66,0.1);
  }
  .nb-policy__card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  .nb-policy__section-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1A3A42;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .nb-policy__icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 36px; height: 36px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4AACBF, #2F8FA3);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(74,172,191,0.25);
  }
  .nb-policy__body {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: #4B5A60;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .nb-policy__email {
    color: #2F8FA3;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(47,143,163,0.5);
  }
  .nb-policy__email:hover { color: #1A3A42; }

  .nb-policy__chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .nb-policy__chip {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    background: #F0F9FB;
    border: 1px solid rgba(74,172,191,0.25);
    color: #1A3A42;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .nb-policy__help {
    margin-top: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 22px 26px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A3A42 0%, #2F8FA3 100%);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(26,58,66,0.18);
  }
  .nb-policy__help-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 44px; height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(185,232,245,0.3);
  }
  .nb-policy__help-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .nb-policy__help-sub {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(185,232,245,0.9);
  }
  .nb-policy__help .nb-policy__email { color: #B9E8F5; border-bottom-color: rgba(185,232,245,0.5); }
  .nb-policy__help .nb-policy__email:hover { color: #FFFFFF; }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .nb-policy__hero { padding: 70px 16px 70px; }
    .nb-policy__wrap { padding: 0 16px; }
    .nb-policy__card, .nb-policy__intro { padding: 22px 20px; }
    .nb-policy__help { padding: 20px; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; text-align: left; }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "NB Terms of Service",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{"name": "NB Terms of Service", "category": "NexaBrand"}]
}
{% endschema %}
